Add a tactical loading screen (#995)

* Add a tactical loading screen

Hold the scene behind an opaque overlay with one progress bar per
loading stage, then fade in once the scene is presented and its render
pipelines have compiled. A lost connection, a missing required asset or
a load that stops advancing ends in a failure panel with Retry and Exit.

* Install pipeline readiness with the game's loading gate

Only the game binary reads the pipeline counter, so the shared presentation plugin does not need to register it. This keeps that plugin's build function within its 100-line ceiling after #994.

* Give the loading screen its own equipment check

Keep EquipmentReadiness as main has it, browser and test only, since a native build reads none of its queries. The loading gate only needs to know that generation has finished for what characters carry.